      "detail": "canvas draws at 1.5x on a 3x screen, 0.7 megapixels",
      "fix": "Cap the pixel ratio at 1.5 on touch screens (2 at most) and lower it when frames get slow. A 3x canvas draws 9 pixels for every CSS pixel."
    },
    {
